17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"A security guard's core function is deterrence, observation, and reporting. Presence prevents a great deal on its own. Beyond that, the job is to see accurately, record precisely, and get the right people involved — not to enforce law, which you have no special authority to do."}]
18:["$","figure","2",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full text-left border-collapse","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50","children":[["$","th","0",{"scope":"col","className":"px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200","children":""}],["$","th","1",{"scope":"col","className":"px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200","children":"Security guard"}],["$","th","2",{"scope":"col","className":"px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200","children":"Police officer"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"className":"even:bg-gray-50/50","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Authority"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Generally that of a private citizen"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Sworn peace officer authority"}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"className":"even:bg-gray-50/50","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Arrest powers"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Limited citizen's arrest, narrowly defined and risky"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Statutory arrest authority"}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"className":"even:bg-gray-50/50","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Use of force"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Only what a private person may lawfully use"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Governed by law and departmental policy"}]]}],["$","tr","3",{"className":"even:bg-gray-50/50","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Legal protection"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Personally liable for wrongful acts"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Qualified immunity in defined circumstances"}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"className":"even:bg-gray-50/50","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Jurisdiction"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"The property you are assigned to"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Their jurisdiction"}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"className":"even:bg-gray-50/50","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Primary duty"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Deter, observe, report"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-100 align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Investigate and enforce"}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"What separates a guard from a police officer"}]]}]
19:["$","div","3",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-400","children":[false,"Exceeding your authority exposes you personally. A guard who detains someone without lawful grounds can face false imprisonment claims; one who uses force beyond what is justified can face assault charges and civil liability. Your employer's insurance may not cover an act outside your authorized duties, and criminal liability is never insurable. The safest and most professional response to almost any incident is to observe accurately and call."]}]
1a:["$","div","4",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-primary-200 bg-primary-50/50 p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-700 mb-2","children":"Worked example"}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1","children":"Responding to a theft in progress"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-5","children":"You observe someone removing property from a vehicle in your assigned lot."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold","children":1}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900","children":"Do not approach. Move to a position where you can see clearly and safely."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-1","children":"Distance keeps you safe and keeps you observing. A guard who closes the distance stops being a witness and becomes a participant, and the quality of your observation drops the moment you are in a confrontation."}]]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold","children":2}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900","children":"Call police immediately, before anything else."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-1","children":"They have the authority and the backup. Every second you spend deciding whether to intervene is a second they are not on their way."}]]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold","children":3}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900","children":"Record specifics while you can still see them."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-1","children":"Description, clothing, direction of travel, vehicle make and plate, time. Memory degrades fast under stress, and these are the details that make a report useful rather than vague."}]]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold","children":4}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900","children":"Follow your post orders on whether to observe from a distance or withdraw."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-1","children":"Post orders exist because the client and the employer have decided how this site is handled. Following them protects you; improvising does not."}]]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold","children":5}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900","children":"Write the report while it is fresh, and stick to what you saw."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-1","children":"Your report may become evidence. Record observations, not conclusions — 'a man in a gray jacket removed a bag from the vehicle', not 'a thief broke into the car'."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-primary-200 text-gray-800","children":["$L1f","Police are en route with a usable description, and you are safe and still a credible witness."]}],"$L20"]}]
1b:["$","$L21","5",{"block":{"type":"knowledge-check","question":"You witness someone stealing from a vehicle on the property you patrol. What is the correct response?","options":["Detain the person until police arrive","Observe from a safe distance, call police immediately, and record a detailed description","Confront them and demand they return the property","Follow them off the property to see where they go"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"A guard's authority is generally that of a private citizen, and a physical intervention creates legal and personal risk with no corresponding authority. Observing safely and providing an accurate description is both the safest response and the most useful one.","optionRationales":["Detention without lawful grounds risks a false imprisonment claim, and citizen's arrest is narrowly defined and dangerous.","Correct. Distance, a call, and a description.","Confrontation escalates a property crime into a risk to your safety.","Leaving your assigned post and pursuing removes you from your authority and your protection."]}}]
1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3","children":"Challenge"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl","children":"Apply what you've learned in this lesson."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-200 p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Find what applies in your state — authority is defined by state law."}],["$","ol","1",{"start":"$undefined","className":"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:font-semibold marker:text-primary-600","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Find your state's licensing requirements for security guards: training hours, registration, fees, and background check."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Research the citizen's arrest law in your state and write down its limits in two sentences."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Find out whether armed guard licensure is separate in your state and what additional requirements it carries."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Write a description of a person and a vehicle in the level of detail a report would need."}]]}]]}]}]]}]
